    "source": "canonical.written_solution",
    "target_status": "source_written",
    "target_text": "Read the first rotation control value in the top row: 1 \u2192 identity, 2 \u2192 90\u00b0 clockwise, 3 \u2192 180\u00b0, and 4 \u2192 270 degrees. Take the first connected red(2) component in row-major order as the template, normalize and rotate it, then stamp it in green(3) with its top-left corner on the cyan(8) anchor. The output is otherwise background."
  },
